b/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅなたんともみなたんとも\nツーショットないから\n3ショットで許してください(´◦ω◦`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は秋っぽく！\nワンピースにベレー帽かぶりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛もまきまきに！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月29日 in ポートメッセ名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 りしゃこ(`･ω･´)  (矢田 里沙子)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は前髪を編みこんで\n内巻きにしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会恥ずかしかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに指してるリボンは\nみり愛に借りたものです！\nありがとうね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりちゃん(渡辺 みり愛)と♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅな、みな、りしゃこのファンの方、そしてきいちゃんファンの方ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会はほんとにたのしい♡\nやっぱりファンの方と直接顔を合わせて\n声を聞けて笑顔が見れて、\n本当に楽しいし幸せです(´,,･ω･,,`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして9月22日に、兄抜きの家族みんなで鎌倉にいきましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねあのね、砂浜にチップの足跡が\nなんまらめんこいんよー(灬ºωº灬)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに人間の足跡はままちゃんの足跡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅなのブログにもあったように\nこの間、みなとじゅなとひなで\nデートに行きお泊りをしました♡\nもーすっごく楽しかった♡\n最近はいつも一緒(´･ω･`) 人(´･ω･`)♡\nこれからもずっと一緒♡\n今度3人でディズニーに行ってきます！\nじゅなもみなもだーいすき♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どあっぷっぷ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間のきいちゃんがきいちゃおう！\nの答えのクリスマスの物の正解は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"リース\"  でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんな、イルミネーションって\n答えてて正解者は少なかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しかったかな(*´罒`*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リースの写真は、12月ドアに飾ったら\n載せますね♡\n変わった形だから、楽しみにしておいてくださーい(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして今週の日曜日\n10月6日は代々木でLIVEがありますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このことについては、いろいろ気持ちがあるので次回のブログで書かせてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく今は頑張ることしか\n頭にありません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るのでみなさん\n楽しんでくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメフト知ってるー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→知ってますよ！肩ぱんぱんのユニフォーム着てするスポーツですよね！\nこの間わんちゃんの洋服にもアメフトデザインの洋服があって方のとこがもこもこしてました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木でレスくれー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そりゃもちろん！\n応援してくれるみなさんにあげます♡だから、是非受け取ってね♡\nみなさんのこと見極めてちゃんと探すからね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな季節はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→えーっとね...迷うな～\n春も夏も秋も冬もそれぞれ\nいいところがあってどれも好き！\nでも、強いて言うなら\n学校のお休みが長い夏休みか\nイルミネーションやツリーや雪が\nキレイな冬！\nもこもこの洋服も着れるしね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントや手紙を送ったんだけど\nもらったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ありがとうございます！本当に嬉しいです♡でも、まだ受け取れてなくて...\nまた私の所まで届いたらブログにのせるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウム何色がいいー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→何色があるんだろう....\n好きな色はピンクと黄緑！\nだからピンクと黄緑を一緒に持っていてくれれば、うれしいです♡\n黄緑ってなさそうだな～\nそしたら黄色か緑(灬ºωº灬)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント整理がまだ追いついてなくて\n質問返しが少ないね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い切って次は質問10個以上返すぞ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に\nきいちゃんがきいちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46でのオススメ曲と\n好きな曲を教えてくださーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIVEたのしみー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/01/3312128/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"key-chan(♡˙︶˙♡)"}],"source":"archive"}}